    "['ip address [ip-address] [subnet-mask]', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'ip address 1.1.1.1 255.255.255.0', 'parent_command': ['interface Loopback0'], 'root': 'interface Loopback0', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': '##\\nip address 1.1.1.1 255.255.255.0\\n##\\n\\nNote: The command syntax is identical between Huawei and Cisco for configuring an IP address on an interface. Both use the same format:\\n`ip address <ip> <mask>`', 'trans_template': 'ip address 1.1.1.1 255.255.255.0'}]]": 1,
